        "locator": "{\"end_char\": 10456, \"end_line\": 524, \"offset_unit\": \"UNICODE_CODE_POINTS\", \"pdf_file\": null, \"pdf_reference_base\": \"LANE_ROOT\", \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [], \"span_semantics\": \"EXACT_QUOTE\", \"start_char\": 10219, \"start_line\": 519}",
        "exact_excerpt": " \nFrom these places the rovers issued to capture, to \ndestroy, and to enslave: in Oran and Tlemcen, in \nTenes, Shershell, Bougie, Jigelli, Bizerta, Sfax, \nSusa, Monastir, Jerbah, and Tripoli they lurked \nready for the raid and the foray.",
